### Creation d'un compte
POST http://localhost:8083/commands/accounts/create
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerName": "Hicham Ouaouche",
  "currency": "MAD",
  "initialBalance": 5400
}

### Credit du compte (remplacer l'identifiant par celui retourne ci-dessus)
PUT http://localhost:8083/commands/accounts/credit
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "accountId": "4288c701-5fc2-45d5-84bc-05dd9d23cace",
  "currency": "MAD",
  "amount": 8700
}

### Debit du compte
PUT http://localhost:8083/commands/accounts/debit
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "accountId": "4288c701-5fc2-45d5-84bc-05dd9d23cace",
  "currency": "MAD",
  "amount": 12000
}

### Debit refuse : solde insuffisant
PUT http://localhost:8083/commands/accounts/debit
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "accountId": "4288c701-5fc2-45d5-84bc-05dd9d23cace",
  "currency": "MAD",
  "amount": 9000000
}

### Suspension du compte
PUT http://localhost:8083/commands/accounts/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "accountId": "4288c701-5fc2-45d5-84bc-05dd9d23cace",
  "status": "SUSPENDED"
}

### Sequence d'evenements de l'agregat dans l'Event Store
GET http://localhost:8083/commands/accounts/eventStore/4288c701-5fc2-45d5-84bc-05dd9d23cace
